## Fixed hypothesis results

Explorer filters do not recompute these predefined tests, preventing post-hoc significance hunting.

For H3, the specified logistic regression is omitted when convergence or separation
diagnostics fail. Any Mantel-Haenszel estimate is labelled as a post-convergence
exploratory sensitivity—not a substitute for the failed primary model—and its retained population,
sparse-cell correction and common-odds-ratio heterogeneity test are disclosed below.

