- **Randomization:** maintenance garage.
- **Treatment:** shortlist plus structured condition-review checklist.
- **Control:** existing review process.
- **Primary outcome:** actionable intervention confirmed within 90 days.
- **Secondary outcomes:** inspection hours per finding, six-month downtime and emergency work orders.
- **Analysis:** intention-to-treat with garage-clustered standard errors.
- **Power:** pending a baseline rate and minimum worthwhile improvement.
